[A]Chandni Jharne Ghatayen        [A]Geet Baarish Titliyaan
[C]Hum Pe Ho[D]Gaye Hai Sab Maher[E]ban        [E]Kaisi Hai Yeh Rut Ke Jis Mein
[E]Phool Ban Ke[Dm]Dil[E]Khile

{c: Verse 1}
[G]Dekho Nadi Ke[D]Kinare        Panchi Puk[A]are Kisi Panchi[G]Ko
[G]Dehko Yeh Jo[D]Nadi Hai        Milne[A]Chali Hai Sagar Hi[G]Ko
Yeh[C]Pyaar Ka Hi[D]Sara Hai[E]Caravan        [E]Kaisi Hai Yeh Rut Ke Jis Mein
[E]Phool Ban Ke[Dm]Dil[E]Khile

{c: Verse 1}
[G]Kaise Kisi Ko Bat[D]ayen        Kaise Yeh[A]Samjaayen Kya Pyaar[G]Hai
[G]Is Mein Bandhan[D]Nahin Hai        Aur Na[A]Koyi Bhi Deewaar[G]Hai
Suno[C]Pyaar Ki[D]Nirali Hai[E]Daastaan

